        "id": 140922,
        "name": "PeterCHayward",
        "username": "PeterCHayward",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/peterchayward/{size}/2098_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-18T02:42:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey guys!</p><p><span>Here's the details for all the tournaments (links go to the facebook events):</span></p><ul>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/1582533175357079/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><strong>23rd-24th May: Melbourne</strong></a> - The Games Laboratory (free entry, top 2 teams win PAX Australia 3-day passes)</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/822104994526563/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><strong>30th May: Toowoomba</strong></a> - Battlestations Games (free entry, winning team wins PAX Australia 3-day passes)</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/467854656706316/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><strong>6th-7th June: Brisbane</strong></a> - Good Games Brisbane (free entry, top 2 teams win PAX Australia 3-day passes)</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/339215932869516/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><strong>20th-21st: Canberra</strong></a> - Jolt Games (free entry, top 2 teams win PAX Australia 3-day passes)</span></li>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/580849958684794/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">27th-28th:</a> Sydney - Good Games Town Hall ($20/team entry; top 2 teams win PAX Australia 3-day passes, top 4 teams win in-store credit)</span></li>\n</ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div>They're gonna be amazing, and it's a great way to introduce your friends to the world of Sentinels. I'm going to be in each store for a day or two beforehand, teaching how the game works, so even if you/your mates haven't had a chance to give Tactics a spin yet, this tournament is still for you!</div>",
        "post_number": 4,
